codex
The first follow-up commit fixes the unit-size sentinel example, adds dependency-place uniqueness with a duplicate-place counterexample, adds grant-state defaults, and clarifies README O3.

I’m now replacing the generative transitions’ invariant rechecks with local guards and structural preservation proofs. Activation targeting and direct owner lending remain unchanged while I check whether the cited decisions settle them.
