codex
Call-state bookkeeping now builds with its stronger invariant: pending parameters and loan IDs are unique, every pending ID exists, and the pending flags match the buffer exactly. `passDown` refuses duplicate parameters, and lifecycle events other than entry refuse an unfinished argument buffer. Preservation proofs cover both operations, with duplicate, dangling-ID and stale-leave counterexamples.
